{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22351","headline":"题赠定光上人 · 白居易","name":"题赠定光上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二十身出家，四十心离尘。\n得径入大道，乘此不退轮。\n一坐十五年，林下秋复春。\n春花与秋气，不感无情人。\n我来如有悟，潜以心照身。\n误落闻见中，忧喜伤形神。\n安得遗耳目，冥然反天真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22351.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22351","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}